      "language": "en",
      "transcript": "Marco: Benvenuti! I’m Marco. I cleared you a place in Studio B. Had to move Giulia’s coffee. Giulia: I’m Giulia. I run the desk. Touch my coffee again and you’re in the corridor, Marco. Come in. Three small steps. Then we’re on air.",
