      "kind": "speech",
      "language": "en",
      "transcript": "Marco: We are on! Right now, out of that little speaker in your hand. If you can hear me, and you should, say yes. Giulia: The machine knows it pressed play. It cannot hear your room. That part is yours, not his.",
